Higashi Hongan-ji Temple is a Buddhist temple of Jodo Shinshu ( the True Pure Land Sect of Buddhism ) located in Shimogyo Ward , Kyoto City , Kyoto Prefecture .
It is the head temple of the Otani School of Shinshu sect ( Shinshu sect ) , one of the Shinshu sect 's <unk> ( Shinshu sect ) , and is the head temple of Jodo Shinshu Sect ( the True Pure Land Sect of Buddhism ) along with Nishi Hongan-ji Temple ( the formal name , Hongan-ji Temple ) .
