It was located in the east of Nishi Hongan-ji Temple located in the present Shichijo , Karasuma Ward , Kyoto City , and was called Higashi Hongan-ji Temple because it was located in the east of Horikawa Shichijo .
In 1987 , Hongan-ji Temple was dissolved as a religious corporation related to the Otani school and the <unk> , and it was considered to be a combination of the sect .
